Z||000000||Alex4mula||05-07-2001||10:24 AM||||I found an 88 coupe in pretty decent shape for around $1500 (base model, auto, great body except faded paint, 125K miles, decent interior, good A/C and runs very good). Is that a good price? I maybe planning later to put either a 4.9 caddy or a SBC 350 with Archies kit. Is this car a good platform for that? Is the auto tranny the same on V6s and 4 cyls? Thanks.||||reg||1
