Z||000002||Raydar||05-07-2001||11:54 AM||||According to Ed Parks the 4 cyl auto tranny has different final gearing than the V-6. Seems like he said 2.84. <BR>One of Ed's "partners" said that the 88 cradle is weaker than than the earlier years. Needs to be reinforced to withstand the torque of anything larger than a 3.4.<P>Yeah. That sounds like a good price. Jump on it.  <BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||14
